{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"tools":[{"name":"getChanges","description":"Track what changed between dataset versions:\n\n- **station**: Name, code, coordinates, aliases changed\n- **train**: Train number, name, or discontinued\n- **route**: Stops added/removed from train\n- **timetable**: Arrival/departure times changed\n\n**Polling workflow**:\n1. Store `meta.current_version` from any response\n2. Later, call `/v1/changes?since_version={stored_version}`\n3. Paginate with cursor until `next_cursor` is null\n4. Store the new `meta.current_version` for next poll\n","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"_endpoint":{"default":"/v1/changes","description":"Endpoint: GET /v1/changes","hidden":true,"type":"string"},"_method":{"default":"GET","description":"HTTP method","hidden":true,"type":"string"},"change_type":{"description":"Filter by change type","enum":["added","removed","modified"],"in":"query","type":"string"},"cursor":{"description":"Pagination cursor","in":"query","maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"entity_type":{"description":"Filter by entity type","enum":["station","train","route","timetable"],"in":"query","type":"string"},"limit":{"default":50,"description":"Maximum results per page","in":"query","maximum":200,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"offset":{"default":0,"description":"[DEPRECATED] Use cursor instead","in":"query","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"since_version":{"default":"ds_20251229_144349_1aa422f0","description":"Return changes since this dataset version","in":"query","maxLength":80,"type":"string"}}}},{"name":"getTrain","description":"Get train metadata by UUID or train number.\nSupports conditional requests with ETag.\n","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"_endpoint":{"default":"/v1/trains/{train_id}","description":"Endpoint: GET /v1/trains/{train_id}","hidden":true,"type":"string"},"_method":{"default":"GET","description":"HTTP method","hidden":true,"type":"string"},"train_id":{"default":"12951","description":"Train identifier: